      "writtenOn": "2022-09-21T22:19:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m not sure why EntryWithSize is being used for the cache key? Usually something named \"Entry\" refers to the value in the cache only, not the key.\n\nIf we really need this, would suggest renaming to something more generic like DataAndSize.\n\nBut more generally, can\u0027t we use K directly as the cache key?",
